<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- E-470 Highway Authority , Colo.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- E-470 Highway Authority , Colo.</headline>
<text>
<p>E-470 PUBLIC HIGHWAY AUTHOURITY</p>
<p>RE: $822,287,729.60</p>
<p>SENIOR REVENUE BONDS</p>
